  m_text: 'Last survivor: Players are randomly assigned as zombie or human. Humans defend themselves with their weapons to survive each round. Zombies infect humans, and if you infect a human you may become human again or stay a zombie. Each round ends when all humans are infected, all zombies are killed, or time runs out.'
